The [[Belladonna's Shade]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining the [[Shortbow]] with a [[Pestilence Flask]]. It is an upgrade of the [[Shortbow]], and arguably the strongest one, as it deals the most base damage, and has a high chance of inflicting 2 {{icon/poison}} on hit, along with another debuff.

Debuff and {{icon/poison}} builds would surely appreciate the low stamina cost and high debuff buildup of the [[Belladonna's Shade]]. Consider the synergy with [[Poison Ivy]], which can always be obtained by [[Ranger]]s as their subclass.
==Description==
''It is all kinds of disgusting, every single one.''

